			"notes": "Atmosphere+ 0.6.0-beta.2\n\nPersistence safety beta.\n\n- Added safer atomic file writes for config, themes, custom presets, profile exports, and preset pack exports.\n- Added save/load failure logging for persistence operations.\n- Added corrupt-file quarantine backups for config, custom themes, and custom presets.\n- Added timestamped profile backup exports so older backups are not overwritten.\n- Added automatic before-import profile backups before replacing profiles.\n- Added timestamped config migration backups with limited pruning.\n- Preserved existing visual, UI, profile, preset, and gameplay behavior."
		},
