			"notes": "Theme Studio and UI polish update.\n\n- Improved Theme Studio compact layout for 1920x1080 GUI scale 3.\n- Reduced excessive scrolling in Theme Studio on constrained layouts.\n- Improved Live Preview behavior so it stays useful without hiding controls.\n- Fixed Home screen tip/status text overlap at high GUI scale.\n- Cleaned up duplicate imported preset names.\n- Retuned End presets for smoother, less overly rich cosmic visuals.\n- Improved imported preset row polish.\n\nThis is a beta release focused on UI polish and Preset Pack stability before the stable v0.4.0 release."
		},
